Subject: [PATCH] feat: password reset + dashboard manual verification
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Password reset (self-serve + admin-assisted):
- POST /auth/forgot-password — always responds 200 with a uniform message
  (no user enumeration); throttled to 3 requests/email/15min. Issues a
  single-use token stored as sha256 hash in the previously unused
  VerificationToken table (identifier pwreset:<userId>, 30 min TTL) and
  emails a reset link via Resend when RESEND_API_KEY +
  VERITAS_NOTIFICATIONS_FROM_EMAIL are configured.
- POST /auth/reset-password — consumes the token (single-use), rejects
  expired/unknown tokens, updates the credentials account's bcrypt hash,
  and revokes ALL existing sessions for the user.
- POST /admin/password-reset-link (x-admin-key) — fallback when email
  delivery is not configured: returns a one-time reset URL an operator
  can hand to the user through a trusted channel.
- New src/utils/passwordResetEmail.ts (same Resend rail as purchase
  emails); .env.example documents RESEND_API_KEY + from address.

Dashboard manual verification:
- POST /dashboard/:workspaceId/verify {reference, suffix?, phoneNumber?}
  — session-authenticated + workspace-membership-checked, so the browser
  dashboard can verify a reference without holding a raw API key.
  Consumes one verification credit via an atomic gte-guarded decrement
  (mirrors verifyQuotaGate; BUSINESS tier honours
  businessUnlimitedVerifications). Delegates to the same runSmartVerify
  router as /verify and preserves its response conventions.
